<b>&nbsp;</b></div>
<div style=3D"margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFont=
Service,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
<b>There is a mistake in the address on the form. Can this be changed?</b><=
/div>
<div style=3D"margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFont=
Service,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
<b>&nbsp;</b></div>
<div style=3D"margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFont=
Service,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
Please email <span style=3D"color:rgb(70,120,134)"><a href=3D"mailto:electo=
ral.enquiries@southwark.gov.uk" style=3D"color:rgb(70,120,134)"><u>electora=
l.enquiries@southwark.gov.uk</u></a></span> with your name, address and the=
 error.</div>
<div style=3D"margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFont=
Service,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
&nbsp;</div>
<div style=3D"margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFont=
Service,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
We will investigate and amend if necessary. Any change will take effect on =
publication of the revised electoral register on 1 December 2026.</div>
<div style=3D"margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFont=
Service,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
<b>&nbsp;</b></div>
<div style=3D"margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFont=
Service,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
<b>I am about to move. What should I do?</b></div>
<div style=3D"margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFont=
Service,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
&nbsp;</div>
<div style=3D"margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFont=
Service,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
As soon as you move, apply to register at your new address by visiting <a h=
ref=3D"http://www.gov.uk/register-to-vote" style=3D"color:rgb(0,0,0)">
<u>www.gov.uk/register-to-vote</u></a></div>
<div style=3D"margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFont=
Service,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
&nbsp;</div>
<div style=3D"margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFont=
Service,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
When making your application you must provide your old address =96 this wil=
l make sure that your name is not on the register in two places at the same=
 time.</div>
<div style=3D"margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFont=
Service,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
&nbsp;</div>
<div style=3D"margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFont=
Service,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
<b>Why is the canvass communication not addressed to me?</b></div>
<div style=3D"margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFont=
Service,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
&nbsp;</div>
<div style=3D"margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFont=
Service,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
The purpose of the communication is to identify who should be registered to=
 vote at an address. It is addressed to =91Resident=92 because the person o=
r people that we have registered at an address may no longer be there.</div=
>
<div style=3D"margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFont=
Service,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
<b>&nbsp;</b></div>
<div style=3D"margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFont=
Service,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
<b>I am paying Council Tax. Why am I not registered to vote?</b></div>
<div style=3D"margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFont=
Service,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
<b>&nbsp;</b></div>
<div style=3D"margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFont=
Service,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
Paying Council Tax does not mean you are automatically added to the Elector=
al Register. Not everyone who pays Council Tax is eligible to be registered=
, and not everyone who is eligible to vote at an address will be named on t=
he Council Tax account.</div>
<div style=3D"margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFont=
Service,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
&nbsp;</div>
<div style=3D"margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFont=
Service,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
By law, each individual is responsible for making their own application to =
register to vote.</div>
<div style=3D"margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFont=
Service,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
<b>&nbsp;</b></div>
<div style=3D"margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFont=
Service,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
<b>How do I change my method of voting? (apply for or cancel a postal or pr=
oxy vote)</b></div>
<div style=3D"margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFont=
Service,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
<b>&nbsp;</b></div>
<ul style=3D"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; padding-left:0px">
<li style=3D"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calib=
ri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0); margin:0cm 0cm 0=
cm 18pt">
You can <span role=3D"presentation" style=3D"color:blue"><a href=3D"https:/=
/www.gov.uk/apply-postal-vote" style=3D"color:blue"><u>apply for a postal v=
ote</u></a></span> or
<span role=3D"presentation" style=3D"color:blue"><a href=3D"https://www.gov=
.uk/how-to-vote/voting-by-proxy" style=3D"color:blue"><u>for a proxy vote</=
u></a></span> online.</li><li style=3D"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont=
,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rg=
b(0,0,0); margin:0cm 0cm 0cm 18pt">
To cancel an existing postal or proxy vote, please email <span role=3D"pres=
entation" style=3D"color:blue">
<a href=3D"mailto:electoral.enquiries@southwark.gov.uk" style=3D"color:blue=
"><u>electoral.enquiries@southwark.gov.uk</u></a></span></li></ul>
<div style=3D"margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFont=
Service,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
<b>You cannot cancel a postal or proxy application on someone else=92s beha=
lf - the request must come from the individual concerned.</b></div>
<div style=3D"margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFont=
Service,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
<b>&nbsp;</b></div>
<div style=3D"margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFont=
Service,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
<b>I do not vote so I don=92t want to register=85</b></div>
<div style=3D"margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFont=
Service,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
&nbsp;</div>
<div style=3D"margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFont=
Service,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
It is not a legal requirement to vote but the law requires eligible residen=
ts to register when requested to do so.</div>
<div style=3D"margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFont=
Service,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
<b>&nbsp;</b></div>
<div style=3D"margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFont=
Service,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
There are benefits of being on the register that are unconnected with elect=
ions. Credit referencing agencies are entitled to receive the electoral reg=
ister and use the information contained in it as part of an individual=92s =
credit records, using it as verification
 of their address.</div>
<div style=3D"margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFont=
Service,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
&nbsp;</div>
<div style=3D"margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFont=
Service,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
If someone is not on the electoral register it may affect their ability to =
obtain credit, get a mortgage or access other financial services.&nbsp;</di=
v>
<div style=3D"margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFont=
Service,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
<b>What is the open register?</b></div>
<div style=3D"margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFont=
Service,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
<b>&nbsp;</b></div>
<div style=3D"margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFont=
Service,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
There are two versions of the electoral register =96 the full version and t=
he =91open register=92:</div>
<div style=3D"margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFont=
Service,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
<b>&nbsp;</b></div>
<div style=3D"margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFont=
Service,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
The full register</div>
<div style=3D"margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFont=
Service,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
Everyone=92s name and address is included on the full version of the electo=
ral register. The full version of the register is only used for:</div>
<div style=3D"margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFont=
Service,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
<b>&nbsp;</b></div>
<ul style=3D"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; padding-left:0px">
<li style=3D"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calib=
ri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0); margin:0cm 0cm 0=
cm 18pt">
electoral purposes (including campaigning by political parties)</li><li sty=
le=3D"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helv=
etica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0); margin:0cm 0cm 0cm 18pt=
">
preventing and detecting crime</li><li style=3D"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_Emb=
eddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt;=
 color:rgb(0,0,0); margin:0cm 0cm 0cm 18pt">
used by credit reference agencies to check credit applications</li><li styl=
e=3D"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helve=
tica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0); margin:0cm 0cm 0cm 18pt"=
>
<div role=3D"presentation">jury summoning in England, Wales and Northern Ir=
eland<br>
</div>
</li></ul>
<div style=3D"margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFont=
Service,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
The open register</div>
<div style=3D"margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFont=
Service,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
This is an extract of the electoral register, which is not used for electio=
ns. Any person, company or organisation can buy a copy of this register. Fo=
r example, it can be used by businesses and charities to confirm name and a=
ddress details or for mailing lists.</div>
<div style=3D"margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFont=
Service,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
&nbsp;</div>
<div style=3D"margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFont=
Service,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
You may choose to have your name removed from the open register. Removing y=
our details from the open register does not affect your right to vote.</div=
>
<div style=3D"margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFont=
Service,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
&nbsp;</div>
<div style=3D"margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFont=
Service,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
The canvass communication will indicate the registered voters who have opte=
d out of the open register.</div>
<div style=3D"margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFont=
Service,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
<b>&nbsp;</b></div>
<div style=3D"margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFont=
Service,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
<b>How do I remove my name from the open register?</b></div>
<div style=3D"margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFont=
Service,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
<b>&nbsp;</b></div>
<div style=3D"margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFont=
Service,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
You can ask for your name and address to be excluded from the Open Register=
 on a permanent basis. You can make your request by emailing
<span style=3D"color:rgb(70,120,134)"><a href=3D"mailto:electoral.enquries@=
southwark.gov.uk" style=3D"color:rgb(70,120,134)"><u>electoral.enquries@sou=
thwark.gov.uk</u></a></span>&nbsp;</div>
<div style=3D"margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFont=
Service,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
&nbsp;</div>
<ul style=3D"margin-top:0cm; margin-right:0cm; padding-left:0px">
<li style=3D"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calib=
ri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0); margin:0cm 0cm 0=
cm 18pt">
you cannot do this on behalf of another person</li><li style=3D"font-family=
:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;=
 font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0); margin:0cm 0cm 0cm 18pt">
<a name=3D"_Int_Fsb2QHOA">each individual</a> must inform the Electoral Reg=
istration Officer separately that they want to do this</li></ul>
<div style=3D"margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFont=
Service,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
<b>&nbsp;</b></div>
<div style=3D"margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFont=
Service,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
<b>Why do you write to my property every year?</b></div>
<div style=3D"margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFont=
Service,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
<b>&nbsp;</b></div>
<div style=3D"margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFont=
Service,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
The Electoral Registration Officer is required by law to carry out a househ=
old canvass each year to determine who should be registered to vote. This i=
ncludes not only identifying where changes need to be made, but also confir=
ming where there is no change needed
 to registered elector details.</div>
<div style=3D"margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFont=
Service,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
<b>&nbsp;</b></div>
<div style=3D"margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFont=
Service,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
<b>I have responded to the form already. Why have received a reminder form?=
</b></div>
<div style=3D"margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFont=
Service,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
<b>&nbsp;</b></div>
<div style=3D"margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFont=
Service,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
It takes several days to print, dispatch and deliver reminder forms. There =
is always a cross-over period after data for the reminder forms is sent to =
our print contractors and the forms are finally delivered. Your response ma=
y not have been received by us when
 we sent the reminder data to our printers.</div>
<div style=3D"margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFont=
Service,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
<b>&nbsp;</b></div>
<div style=3D"margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFont=
Service,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
<b>For more information about the electoral register and voter registration=
, please visit the Electoral Commission=92s
</b><span style=3D"color:rgb(70,120,134)"><a href=3D"https://www.electoralc=
ommission.org.uk/i-am-a/voter" style=3D"color:rgb(70,120,134)"><b><u>websit=
e</u></b></a></span><b>.</b></div>
<div style=3D"margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFont=
Service,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
